to/msid-135655018,imgsize-70120.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[BJP chief Nitin Nabin asks opposition to follow LK Advani's approach to national security]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjp-chief-nitin-nabin-asks-opposition-to-follow-lk-advanis-approach-to-national-security/articleshow/135654347.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135654347.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[BJP president Nitin Nabin highlighted L K Advani's legacy during a special event for his 100th birthday. He urged opposition parties to unite during national security challenges, following Advani's example. Nabin credited Advani and Atal Bihari Vajpayee for the BJP's growth from its early years to its current prominence. The significance of Advani's contributions to the Ram Janmabhoomi movement was also recognized at the event.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjp-chief-nitin-nabin-asks-opposition-to-follow-lk-advanis-approach-to-national-security/articleshow/135654347.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjp-chief-nitin-nabin-asks-opposition-to-follow-lk-advanis-approach-to-national-security/articleshow/135654347.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T13:45:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135654602,imgsize-1012597.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rajasthan's local poll rolls have 30 lakh more voters than EC's final SIR list: Activist]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rajasthans-local-poll-rolls-have-30-lakh-more-voters-than-ecs-final-sir-list-activist/articleshow/135653873.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.